flowchart LR
    INVESTIGATOR[TrialIQ Investigator] --> UI[Investigator Console\nReact + Vite]
    UI --> API[TrialIQ FastAPI]

    API -->|Direct mode| DIRECT[Deterministic TrialIQ services]
    API -->|Guided mode| INTENT[LLM structured intent\nExtractedQueryIntent]
    INTENT --> SUP[TrialIQ SupervisorAgent]
    SUP --> MCPCLIENT[FastMCPRetrievalClient]
    MCPCLIENT --> MCP[TrialIQ FastMCP tools]
    MCP --> GRAPHQ[Graph query service\nfixed/parameterized Cypher]
    GRAPHQ --> NEO[(Neo4j canonical graph)]

    NEO --> METRICS[Deterministic related-trial metrics]
    METRICS --> REVIEW{Candidate count > 6?}
    REVIEW -->|Yes| HITL[Investigator HITL selection]
    REVIEW -->|No| VALIDATION[Deterministic validation]
    HITL --> VALIDATION
    VALIDATION --> SYNTH[LLM structured grounded synthesis\nStructuredSynthesis]
    SYNTH --> API
    DIRECT --> API
    API --> UI

    AACT[(AACT PostgreSQL\nctgov)] --> ETL[TrialIQ canonical ETL\nload + reconciliation]
    ETL --> NEO
    AACT -. source verification .-> VALIDATION
